# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
graft/

# Agent customization is versioned. This block MUST stay last: git applies the last
# matching rule, so a negation placed above `*.md` / `*.sh` / `*.txt` / `*.csv` would
# lose to them. Negating the whole tree (not just *.md) means a future helper file
# cannot vanish from git — and because Biome honours this file, it would lose its
# linting too.
!.github/**
!AGENTS.md
